    "reviews": [
      {
        "author_name": "Craig Emblem",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/107783443102495102148/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjW2H66iE7Du3yLP1NfEodEebvoEX18DPGQhUE2e6Ze0IiKw7wqR=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 months ago",
        "text": "I’m very happy with the service provided by Richard & Fils. I had a water leak in my ceiling caused by cracked PEX tubing from previous renovations (likely old owners). They arrived on time, and the technician was professional, clean, and pleasant to speak with. The repair was done efficiently, and everything was left tidy. I highly recommend Richard & Fils for any plumbing needs. Thank you!",
        "time": 1764441340,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Gabrielle Landry",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/107611339917668568135/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIFjMDd5PC9WQTyt740TFzE8Bo-75nSrY28GZQ5e0MD1sI7LQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "7 months ago",
        "text": "Plumber (Charles) passed a camera in our storm drain and said there were no cracks and it’s was in good condition. He provided a two line report which I helped with stating it was a functional pipe. After watching the video on the USB he gave me, I saw a crack. I had the owner (Philip) watch the video and he said the pipe needed to be replaced which completely contradicts what Charles said. Thank goodness I diligently watched the video. I had to pay another 500$ for a different plumber (Deritec - highly recommend) to pass a camera and confirm there were in fact two cracks. Deritec provided a two page detailed report for our insurance.\n\nDo not use Richard et Fils. The owner, Philip, was rude and unprofessional but did reimburse us 100%.",
        "time": 1751844122,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Sabrina (Sabrina)",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/116486111880267366347/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWh3isWPSjm21k88ax7_bhRjdBWiocljk3kE_i3A65AIJts-hQY=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3",
        "rating": 4,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "I had the pleasure of working with Yuri who was very professional and polite. He walked me through the process of the work that needed to be done, as well as letting me know the potential risks (I live in a condo building). He gave me tips and tricks for the future to help mitigate any future damages.\n\nI really appreciated how quickly and responsive the team was on the phone. I would definitely work with this company again.\n\nThe only reason I removed a star is that I had originally called for active flooding and as an emergency, the plumber never arrived (but another one was sent in the morning). I would have appreciated a call as I waited all night for someone to arrive. Otherwise, I am very happy wth the service.",
        "time": 1708707177,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "F Corriveau",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/107252767774663353300/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUJZqfJ21yIIjaF0SbadkhodqeVEqlpO6efrYvdakGEg0kmox76=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 2,
        "relative_time_description": "2 years ago",
        "text": "A few jobs were done at my place before, professionally and quickly executed and I was very satisfied.  Recently however I had a leak in a large return pipe.  The plumber came and for 180$ confirmed it was urgent and that somebody would come for an estimate.  Nobody came.  I phoned 3 times over one full week to be assured each time it would be \"soon\", which turned out could however not be before one more week.  So I gave up, called another company, which sent one of their plumbers on the very next morning to replace the leaking pipe.  The emergency response of R&F Inc was nil, I lost days waiting for them at home with restricted water use and they never bothered to call back. (BTW the online contact page, which I tried many times too, also did not work at all.)",
        "time": 1695397279,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Tao Jiang",
